/// This class is relatively expensive. Avoid using it where possible.¿™	¿±␀␀¿µ¿ª␀␀¿≈¿À␀␀¿÷¿›␀␀¿Í¿¿¿¿˚¿Ò¿˛¿¿¿¿¿%¿M¿9¿1¿&¿4¿G¿<¿J¿SÅ|¿∆ÅN/// If non-null, force the child's width to be a multiple of this value.
